config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_393_DESKTOP_COMPANION
	bool "AI-VOX3 desktop companion demo"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the AI-VOX3 (ESP32-S3-R8) desktop companion demo. Exercises
		the onboard pan/tilt servos (/dev/pwm0,/dev/pwm1), the ST7789 LCD
		(/dev/lcd0) and the user buttons (board_buttons()). Run as the
		'desktop_companion' built-in command from the NSH console.
